<title>USA: Henkel has 96 pct of Loctite shares.</title>
<headline>Henkel has 96 pct of Loctite shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henkel KGaA said Monday it holds 96 percent of the stock of Loctite Corp and expects to close its acquisition of Loctite within the month.</p>
<p>Henkel, through its Henkel Merger Corp unit, bought 19,884,139 million Loctite shares in its tender offer, it said. That amount included about 597,575 shares tendered by notice of guaranteed delivery, it added.</p>
<p>Hnekel said that as a result of the tender, which expired January 3, it holds about 96 percent of Loctite's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Henkel, based in Dsseldorf, Germany, announced the acquisition December 5.</p>
</text>
